{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest"]}],"metadata":{"title":"How to Preview and Test","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" calls into a real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For previews and tests, swap it for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — an actor that records every call and exposes its history for assertions. The mock has no Mixpanel dependency and runs offline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"In a SwiftUI preview","level":2,"anchor":"In-a-SwiftUI-preview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inject a mock-backed store and the analytics work flows without spinning up the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["#Preview {","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: MockMixpanelAnalyticsService())","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This requires that ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore.configured","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" accepts an injected ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". See Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" guide for the factory pattern."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"In-a-Swift-Testing-suite","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"In a Swift Testing suite"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mock to verify mapper behavior. Await the plugin’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" to make assertions deterministic:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import Testing","","@Test","func incrementMapsToCounterAdded() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let events = await mock.trackedEvents","    #expect(events.first?.name == \"counter_added\")","    #expect(events.first?.properties[\"amount\"] == .int(5))","}"]},{"anchor":"Asserting-on-identify-and-alias","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Asserting on identify and alias"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The mock records identify and alias calls in order:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Test","func userSignInIdentifies() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.auth(.signIn(userID: \"user-1\")))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let calls = await mock.identifyCalls","    #expect(calls == [.init(userID: \"user-1\", properties: [\"tier\": .string(\"free\")])])","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is an actor, so its accessors are async — wrap them in ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" from SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites without touching Mixpanel’s network."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"How-to Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"],"generated":true,"anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockServiceReference":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" — a recording ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockservicereference","kind":"article","title":"Mock Service Reference","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"type":"text","text":" internally so apps never need to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockmixpanelanalyticsservice","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}]},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/howtoaddanalytics":{"title":"Add Analytics","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add Analytics"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","abstract":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in your app.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice","kind":"article","title":"How to Implement the Service","role":"article"}}}